(QUANTUM PORTFOLIO OPTIMIZER) Tj
T*
T*
T*
(Overview) Tj
T*
T*
(The "quantum computing" feature in this project is a quantum-inspired portfolio optimizer,) Tj
T*
(not a true quantum hardware implementation. There is no Qiskit, no quantum circuit) Tj
T*
(execution, and no qubit-based runtime in this repository. Instead, the system uses a) Tj
T*
(classical optimization service written in Java that evaluates holdings, estimates return and) Tj
T*
( risk, and suggests portfolio rebalancing actions.) Tj
T*
T*
(The backend exposes this functionality through a Spring endpoint and the frontend calls it) Tj
T*
(from the Holdings page.) Tj
T*
T*
(Main Backend Files) Tj
T*
T*
(- `demo/src/main/java/legacy/firstmodel/controller/QuantumOptimizationController.java`) Tj
T*
(- `demo/src/main/java/legacy/firstmodel/service/QuantumOptimizationService.java`) Tj
T*
(- `demo/src/main/java/legacy/firstmodel/dto/OptimizationRequestDTO.java`) Tj
T*
(- `demo/src/main/java/legacy/firstmodel/dto/OptimizationResponseDTO.java`) Tj
T*
T*
(Main Frontend Files) Tj
T*
T*
(- `legacy-portfolio-app/src/services/quantumService.js`) Tj
T*
(- `legacy-portfolio-app/src/Holdings.jsx`) Tj
T*
(- `legacy-portfolio-app/src/components/QuantumOptimizerCard.jsx`) Tj
T*
(- `legacy-portfolio-app/src/components/OptimizationResultsPanel.jsx`) Tj
T*
(- `legacy-portfolio-app/src/components/AllocationComparisonChart.jsx`) Tj
T*
T*
(End-to-End Flow) Tj
T*
T*
(1. The user opens the Holdings page and expands the Quantum Optimizer.) Tj
T*
(2. The frontend form collects:) Tj
T*
(   - risk tolerance) Tj
T*
(   - target objective) Tj
T*
(   - max holdings) Tj
T*
(   - cash available) Tj
T*
(3. The frontend sends a `POST /quantum/optimize` request.) Tj
T*
(4. The backend controller forwards the request to `QuantumOptimizationService`.) Tj
T*
(5. The service evaluates current holdings, estimates return and risk, computes target) Tj
T*
(weights, and returns recommendations.) Tj
T*
(6. The frontend renders optimization metrics, allocation comparisons, and buy/sell/hold) Tj
T*
(suggestions.) Tj
T*
T*
(What `QuantumOptimizationService` Does) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
